      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The fundamental flaw in globalism is its inherent belief in infinite growth on a finite planet, which is a moral fantasy that ignores human limits. This system prioritizes abstract capital flows over the tangible well-being of the citizen, treating nations as mere cogs in a profit machine. By outsourcing our production and diluting our standards for the sake of cheap imports, globalism systematically erodes the very social cohesion and self-reliance that makes a nation strong. We must reject this flawed calculus and restore the primacy of the domestic community.",
      "source": "target",
